OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 4 APR
OL,4,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,5,     GJess Gillam swaps favourite music
OL,6,     Gwith film composer David Arnold.
OL,7,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,8,     GA dreamlike tale of love and
OL,9,     Gfate, wrapped in Debussy's
OL,10,     Ghypnotic harmonies. This
OL,11,     Gperformance with the BBC Scottish
OL,12,     GSymphony Orchestra brings
OL,13,     GDebussy's astonishing score to
OL,14,     Glife.
OL,15,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,16,     GLopa Kothari curates a selection
OL,17,     Gof roots-based music from across
OL,18,     Gthe globe, including highlights
OL,19,     Gfrom a recent London concert
OL,20,     Gappearance from Mongolian
OL,21,     Gensemble Anda Union.
